#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following option in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if you need to mount a FAT-family filesystem:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite a seguinte opção na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo se "
"você precisar montar um sistema de arquivos da família FAT:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Note that <option>CONFIG_MSDOS_FS</option> deliberately does not support "
"long file names.  <option>CONFIG_VFAT_FS</option> should be used instead "
"unless you really want to enforce the DOS-style <quote>8.3</quote> file "
"names."
msgstr ""
"Observe que <option>CONFIG_MSDOS_FS</option> deliberadamente não suporta "
"nomes longos de arquivos. <option>CONFIG_VFAT_FS</option> deveria ser usada "
"em vez disso, a menos que você realmente queira impor os nomes de arquivo "
"<quote>8.3</quote> no estilo DOS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can mount a FAT-family filesystem once the kernel supports it.  If you "
"don't need to create, check, or relabel a FAT-family system, you may skip "
"this package."
msgstr ""
"Você pode montar um sistema de arquivos da família FAT assim que o núcleo o "
"suportar. Se não precisar criar, verificar ou rotular novamente um sistema "
"da família FAT, você pode ignorar esse pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "FAT Support in Kernel"
msgstr "Suporte FAT no Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of dosfstools"
msgstr "Instalação do dosfstools"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>dosfstools</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>dosfstools</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --enable-compat-symlinks \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man  \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/dosfstools-&dosfstools-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --enable-compat-symlinks \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man  \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/dosfstools-&dosfstools-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/dosfstools.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-compat-symlinks</parameter>: This switch creates the "
"<application>dosfsck</application>, <application>dosfslabel</application>, "
"<application>fsck.msdos</application>, <application>fsck.vfat</application>,"
" <application>mkdosfs</application>, <application>mkfs.msdos</application>, "
"and <application>mkfs.vfat</application> symlinks required by some programs."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-compat-symlinks</parameter>: Essa chave cria os links "
"simbólicos <application>dosfsck</application>, "
"<application>dosfslabel</application>, "
"<application>fsck.msdos</application>, <application>fsck.vfat</application>,"
" <application>mkdosfs</application>, <application>mkfs.msdos</application> e"
" <application>mkfs.vfat</application> exigidos por alguns aplicativos."

